## Critical Cross-Phase Rules

These apply throughout, not just one phase:

### Auto-upload everything

Every checkpoint goes to W&B IMMEDIATELY after training completes via upload_monitor tmux. No exceptions. We lost v7 once; never again.

### Plant cleanup between phases

- Keep only latest.pt for each model
- W&B has versioned history
- Frees disk for next phase

### Validation cadence

- Phase B+D: Drake probes every 5k-10k steps during training
- Phase C: VLM scoring after Phase B completes
- Phase E: VLM scoring on UG subset
- Phase F: Full VLM scoring as part of eval harness

### Commit cadence

After each phase deliverable:
- git add relevant files
- git commit with descriptive message
- Phase results doc updated
- Progress visible on GitHub

### Global halt conditions

Halt entire pipeline if:
- Pod disk < 5 GB free
- Total cost exceeds $35
- v7 checkpoint lost from W&B
- W&B connectivity dies for > 1 hour

