## Risk Map

| Risk | Likelihood | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| v9 uncond Drake validity < 5% | Medium | Phase B gate halts before wasting Phase D compute |
| v9 VLM scores low despite Drake OK | Medium | Phase C catches this cheaply ($1-3) |
| v9 cond Drake < 3% | Medium | Phase D gate; fallback to v9 uncond + v7 cond |
| UG doesn't generalize | High | Already prepared for this story |
| Out of budget | Low | Halt conditions; phases independent |
| Training takes longer | Medium | Reduce max_steps to 100k if needed |
| Disk fills up | Medium | Aggressive cleanup between phases |
| Pod disconnects mid-training | Low | nohup + tmux pattern; auto-resume |

