## What Could Make Us Skip Phases

Skip Phase E (UG) if: Phase D shows v9 cond dramatically better than v7 (>10%). UG was a workaround for low cond validity. If we have it natively, skip.

Skip Phase G ablations if: Out of time. Just ship headline result.

Skip Phase H Hugging Face Space if: Not relevant to immediate portfolio goal.

